### Регистрация пользователя
POST http://localhost:4000/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ivan",
  "email": "ivan.test@mail.ru",
  "password": "secret123",
  "type": "regular"
}

### Вход
POST http://localhost:4000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ivan.test@mail.ru",
  "password": "secret123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.token);
%}

### Проверка состояния
GET http://localhost:4000/users/login

### Загрузка аватара
POST http://localhost:4000/users/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SixCitiesAvatar

--SixCitiesAvatar
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar-max.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../../../markup/img/avatar-max.jpg
--SixCitiesAvatar--

> {%
  client.global.set("avatarUrl", response.body.avatarUrl);
%}

### Получение загруженного аватара
GET http://localhost:4000{{avatarUrl}}
